", "title": "Specific terms and topics:"}, {"id": "a6d57606-7302-4e93-879d-e3275840c52e", "type": "concept", "title": "mighty line"}, {"id": "f4aaface-862b-4d4f-ab57-3ac0671af260", "type": "concept", "title": "iambic pentameter"}, {"id": "281e475b-8614-4bcb-9ef5-e03ae5f2345d", "type": "concept", "title": "enjambment"}, {"id": "e75b5615-973b-4329-9aba-d64c53268beb", "type": "concept", "title": "rhetorical excess"}, {"id": "6bf039a9-03fe-428e-a3bb-22f31cc17cc6", "type": "concept", "title": "soliloquy"}, {"id": "32cbe13d-b507-409d-b087-2ceb6fedbae3", "type": "concept", "title": "hyperbole"}, {"id": "02493d22-19a6-4fba-95f7-dbe555e65b8d", "type": "concept", "title": "stage speech"}], "description": "Students learn how Marlowe's verse creates momentum, grandeur, and pressure on stage."}, {"id": "197dc434-2605-46d6-adc6-226c7a80ed40", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Overreaching protagonists", "children": [{"id": "f5b7b09f-72fe-48b4-8598-4745c49d5748", "type": "concept", "title": "Specific terms and topics:"}, {"id": "08733418-9a8e-4113-a882-2c516991cb0a", "type": "concept", "title": "Tamburlaine"}, {"id": "a536e0d0-d5c7-4695-8573-1265b1bc75b2", "type": "concept", "title": "Doctor Faustus"}, {"id": "b1ab0eee-f035-4c74-9162-2b05e37738e5", "type": "concept", "title": "Barabas"}, {"id": "463b990b-8d2e-4278-b945-fcb19585449a", "type": "concept", "title": "aspiration"}, {"id": "10a95a33-e8df-4f3d-84e8-8f76bbfae045", "type": "concept", "title": "hubris"}, {"id": "161d072e-7198-47ef-afa3-6a3b761c0619", "type": "concept", "title": "contract"}, {"id": "c3f33b1f-bf51-419b-9a3e-ad5af780408d", "type": "concept", "title": "damnation"}, {"id": "dad6acf2-add6-4c78-a896-9a735a19fea4", "type": "concept", "title": "world conquest"}], "description": "The gist is to track ambition as both heroic aspiration and moral catastrophe."}, {"id": "ef049c2b-6d45-4301-abab-6f18eb8470be", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Skepticism, violence, and theatrical risk", "children": [{"id": "5d25224b-599d-44a5-8e2